  "description": "MailForge.Communication is the channel-neutral foundation of the MailForge notification ecosystem. Provides communication abstractions (INotificationSender, IChannel, channel registry, notification envelope), routing rules with fan-out, and the Email channel that plugs the existing email pipeline into the notification model.",
