  "releaseNotes": "- Added notification routing (INotificationRouter, routing rules, builder API) with event/priority/tag/predicate matching.\n      - Added fan-out delivery, per-route transforms, and fallback defaults.\n      - Notification now supports an optional Event for routing.\n      - Existing INotificationSender behavior remains unchanged when routing is not configured.",
